SEC. 51P-742.114. ADDITIONAL PROVISIONS.

(a) The Property must be properly maintained in a state of good repair and neat appearance.

(b) Development and use of the Property must comply with all federal and state laws and regulations, and with all ordinances, rules, and regulations of the city.

(c) Before the issuance of a certificate of occupancy for the first nonresidential use, the following must be provided with final design and construction approved by the director of public works/transportation:

(1) traffic signal at Driveway D, including loop detectors, foundation, conduits, and wiring;

(2) right-turn only lane on southbound Skillman Street at Driveway D;

(3) right-turn only lane and a shared left-turn lane/through lane from the Property at Driveway D;

(4) left-turn only lane and shared right-turn/through lane on Impala Lane at Skillman Street;

(5) left-turn only lane into the Property on westbound Melody Lane at Driveways A and B;

(6) a channelized island for a right-turn in, right-turn out at Driveway E, subject to Texas Department of Transportation approval; and

(7) a hooded left-turn lane on eastbound Northwest Highway at Driveway F, subject to Texas Department of Transportation approval. (Ord. Nos. 26346; 27272)
